@startuml
title An agent's life cycle
' One agent, one task at a time. Before a tool that changes something it
' waits for a person in Approval (<<decide>>). tool-call.mmd is held
' against it: each message the agent gets is an event here.
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<decide>> #FFF1C2
  BorderColor<<decide>> #8B6508
}
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Working : task
state Working {
  [*] --> Thinking
  Thinking --> Calling : picks a tool
  Calling --> Thinking
  Thinking --> [*] : answers
  Thinking --> Approval : wants a change
  Approval --> Calling : approved
  Approval --> Thinking : denied
  state Approval <<decide>>
}
Working --> Idle
Working --> Paused : paused
Paused --> Working : resumed
Working --> Stopped : out of tokens
Stopped --> [*]
@enduml
